# Phishing Prevention Checklist

Use this checklist to improve your online security.

## Email Security

- [ ] Verify the sender's email address.
- [ ] Avoid opening unexpected attachments.
- [ ] Inspect links before visiting websites.
- [ ] Be cautious of urgent payment requests.
- [ ] Report suspicious emails.

## Account Security

- [ ] Use strong and unique passwords.
- [ ] Enable multi-factor authentication.
- [ ] Never share login credentials.
- [ ] Change compromised passwords immediately.
- [ ] Use a reputable password manager.

## General Online Safety

- [ ] Keep software and devices updated.
- [ ] Use trusted websites.
- [ ] Avoid sharing sensitive personal information.
- [ ] Use secure internet connections.
- [ ] Back up important information regularly.

## Final Recommendation

Think before you click.

Always verify unexpected requests for passwords,
payments or confidential information.
